import "res://resources/dialogues/map_common.dialogue" as common

~ start
Thugs: Hey you, give me your money!
- You can take it from my cold, dead hands! #start_battle =>< common/battle
- Okay, you can have it, just don't hurt me! #yield =>< yield
- Maybe we can talk this out? => talk_things_out


~ yield
Thugs: That's right, now keep moving before I get angry!
=>< common/yield

~ talk_things_out
Thugs: Maybe I'll let you choose which of your bones i'll break first!
- Nevermind, I'll just kill you! #start_battle =>< common/battle
- #roll_convince I just think nothing good will come out of us drawing our weapons, you know?  
- #roll_intimidate What if you spare my time and i spare your life?

~ intimidate_success
Thugs: #scared I-I... fine, let's get out of here, boys!
=>< common/scare_speaking_party

~ convince_fail
~ intimidate_fail
Thugs: #angry JUST WHO DO YOU THINK YOU'RE TALKING TO!?!?!?!?
=>< common/battle

~ defeated_player
Thugs: That oughta show you who's boss around these parts!
=> common/finish_dialogue

~ convince_success
Thugs: #persuaded I guess you're right... Then get out of here!
=>< common/pacify_speaking_party